    "title": "Niantic Campfire",
    "description": "Campfire gives the Niantic community a new way to experience the joy of real-world gameplay. \r\n\r\nFind and connect with nearby players to accomplish in-game activities and quests!\r\n\u2022 Discover real-time activities and plan ahead using the Campfire Map\r\n\u2022 Find game communities and meet new players in your area\r\n\u2022 Connect with players through direct messages and group messages\r\n\u2022 Schedule group gatherings with old and new groups\r\n\u2022 Manage your Niantic ID and Niantic friends",
